<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - StorMedia raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - StorMedia raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised its rating for StorMedia Inc to outperform from neutral on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Santa Clara, Calif., thin film disk maker opened up 2-3/8 at 15-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
